# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored.
#
# The same Supabase project as the Flutter dashboard (evolve_academy_dashboard),
# so this app reads the rows the dashboard writes. Ask a maintainer for the
# values — do not copy them out of a Slack message into a tracked file, which is
# what scripts/secret_guard.sh exists to catch.
#
# Both values are public by design: they are compiled into the JavaScript bundle
# and are protected by row-level security, not by secrecy. The anon key grants
# exactly what the RLS policies grant an anonymous visitor and nothing more.
#
# No trailing slash on the URL. The Supabase client appends its own paths, and
# `https://ref.supabase.co//rest/v1` fails a long way from the setting that
# caused it.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
